    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Il s'agit d\u00e9j\u00e0 de l'adresse e-mail que vous utilisez.Entrez-en un autre.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
