    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Vos appareils n'ont pas encore signal\u00e9 la temp\u00e9rature, l'humidit\u00e9 ou la qualit\u00e9 de l'air.Assurez-vous que le capteur est allum\u00e9 et connect\u00e9 au r\u00e9seau.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Derni\u00e8res lectures", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Nous ne produisons pas de partition ;seules les valeurs r\u00e9elles lues sur vos appareils sont affich\u00e9es.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Lorsque vous avez termin\u00e9, ceci est appliqu\u00e9 aux appareils suivants.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
