    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Dernier \u00e9tat et relev\u00e9s connus de vos appareils climatiques.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
