    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Flux d'\u00e9conomies rapides pour les prises intelligentes et les appareils ax\u00e9s sur l'\u00e9nergie.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Rassemblez les prises intelligentes et les appareils consommateurs d\u2019\u00e9nergie en un seul endroit.Cr\u00e9ez des profils d'\u00e9conomie instantan\u00e9s et des actions \u00e9cologiques planifi\u00e9es.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Cr\u00e9ez un panneau d'\u00e9conomie d'\u00e9nergie qui g\u00e8re les prises intelligentes et les appareils consommateurs d'\u00e9nergie.Ajoutez un arr\u00eat rapide, des profils \u00e9cologiques, des \u00e9conomies programm\u00e9es et des r\u00e9sum\u00e9s d'utilisation.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
