    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Apr\u00e8s avoir saisi vos coordonn\u00e9es, vous pouvez facilement r\u00e9initialiser votre mot de passe en suivant les \u00e9tapes que nous vous envoyons.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Utilisez l'application de bureau NEXUS sur votre ordinateur\u00a0;le m\u00eame assistant et les m\u00eames contr\u00f4les y travaillent \u00e9galement.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Discutez \u00e9galement depuis votre ordinateur\u00a0;vos conversations restent synchronis\u00e9es sur vos appareils.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Rejoindre une maison", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Lorsqu'un appareil s'allume ou s'\u00e9teint", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Appuyez sur un appareil pour ouvrir l'\u00e9cran de contr\u00f4le du panneau\u00a0;il affiche uniquement les fonctionnalit\u00e9s prises en charge par l'appareil.Pour les appareils Shelly, WLED et ESPHome, l'allumage/extinction et la luminosit\u00e9 vont directement \u00e0 l'appareil.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ce code est utilis\u00e9 sur l'\u00e9cran Rejoindre un accueil.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
