    "Br\u00fcksel": "Bruxelles", // EN: Brussels
    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ce code \u00e0 8 chiffres est destin\u00e9 au couplage Apple HomeKit et ne fonctionne qu'avec l'application Apple Home.Si l'appareil prend en charge une API locale telle que Shelly, WLED ou Tasmota, vous pouvez l'ajouter depuis votre r\u00e9seau local.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Cet appareil", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ce code QR appartient \u00e0 un r\u00e9seau Wi-Fi, pas \u00e0 un appareil.Apr\u00e8s avoir connect\u00e9 l'appareil au m\u00eame r\u00e9seau, vous pouvez l'ajouter depuis votre r\u00e9seau local.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Aucun appareil NEXUS connu n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9 \u00e0 cette adresse.Assurez-vous que l'appareil est allum\u00e9 et sur le m\u00eame r\u00e9seau.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Cr\u00e9ez cette application intelligente\u00a0:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Pr\u00e9paration des fonctionnalit\u00e9s sugg\u00e9r\u00e9es pour ce flux.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Enregistr\u00e9 ce mois-ci", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Aucun appareil pris en charge n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9 sur ce r\u00e9seau.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Aucun appareil pris en charge n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9 sur ce r\u00e9seau.Assurez-vous que l'appareil est allum\u00e9 et connect\u00e9 au m\u00eame r\u00e9seau Wi-Fi\u00a0;sinon utilisez le catalogue ci-dessous ou un code QR/setup.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
