    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Cet appareil ou cette connexion ne prend pas en charge la lampe de poche.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Cet appareil ne prend pas en charge la localisation automatique.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Ce code d'invitation n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Cet \u00e9cran regroupe les appareils d'\u00e9clairage que vous avez ajout\u00e9s par pi\u00e8ce\u00a0;lorsque vous enregistrez une sc\u00e8ne, la luminosit\u00e9 et la tonalit\u00e9 sont d\u00e9finies ensemble.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Les appareils que vous ajoutez \u00e0 cette maison sont r\u00e9pertori\u00e9s ici.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Les appareils que vous ajoutez \u00e0 cette maison sont r\u00e9pertori\u00e9s ici et li\u00e9s \u00e0 vos cartes pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9es.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "\u00cates-vous s\u00fbr de vouloir supprimer d\u00e9finitivement cette maison et tous ses param\u00e8tres\u00a0?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ce code n'est pas un code d'appareil pris en charge.Si vous connaissez l'adresse IP de l'appareil, vous pouvez l'ajouter depuis votre r\u00e9seau local.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Ces marques sont contr\u00f4l\u00e9es sur votre r\u00e9seau local", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Cette mini application est fournie par le fournisseur officiel.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Cet environnement ne prend pas en charge l'acc\u00e8s \u00e0 la cam\u00e9ra.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "La num\u00e9risation r\u00e9seau n'est pas disponible ici.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Pas de cryptage s\u00e9curis\u00e9 dans cet environnement", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Lorsque ce sc\u00e9nario s'ex\u00e9cute, les appareils associ\u00e9s sont ajust\u00e9s automatiquement.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Aucun appareil n'est concern\u00e9 par ce sc\u00e9nario\u00a0: ajoutez d'abord un appareil appropri\u00e9.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Vous devez ajouter un appareil compatible pour utiliser ce sc\u00e9nario.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
