    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Obtenez des informations sur vos appareils et enregistrez automatiquement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des strat\u00e9gies.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
