    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Pourquoi mon appareil appara\u00eet-il comme \u00e9tant hors ligne\u00a0?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Tapez l'adresse IP de l'appareil et NEXUS d\u00e9terminera quel protocole il parle.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "V\u00e9rifiez la connexion Wi-Fi de l'appareil et votre routeur.Si le probl\u00e8me persiste, supprimez le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique et ajoutez-le \u00e0 nouveau.\u00c9tapes\u00a0:\u00a0Appareils\u00a0> choisissez l'appareil\u00a0>\u00a0Supprimer.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "V\u00e9rifiez la connexion Wi-Fi de l'appareil et votre routeur.Si le probl\u00e8me persiste, supprimez l'appareil de l'application NEXUS et ajoutez-le \u00e0 nouveau.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Si votre appareil n'appara\u00eet pas, utilisez la num\u00e9risation QR ou un code de configuration.Vous pouvez ouvrir la page d'aide pour obtenir de l'aide et des conseils.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Le service de localisation (GPS) de votre appareil est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9.Allumez-le et r\u00e9essayez.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
