    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "\u00c9teignez tous les groupes d\u2019\u00e9clairage laiss\u00e9s allum\u00e9s \u00e0 la maison.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "\u00c0 la maison et \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Absent", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Quand je suis absent", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "G\u00e9rez les lumi\u00e8res de votre maison pi\u00e8ce par pi\u00e8ce en un seul flux.Marche/arr\u00eat, luminosit\u00e9, temp\u00e9rature de couleur et raccourcis de sc\u00e8ne rapides dans une seule application.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Donnez des commandes pr\u00eates \u00e0 l'emploi, des automatisations rapides et des suggestions d'applications intelligentes bas\u00e9es sur les appareils de la maison.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Cr\u00e9ez une application de confort climatique qui g\u00e8re les climatiseurs et les thermostats de votre maison \u00e0 partir d'un seul panneau.Inclut le contr\u00f4le de la temp\u00e9rature, les modes rapides, le mode \u00e9co et les actions bas\u00e9es sur la pi\u00e8ce.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Quel est l'\u00e9tat de mes appareils ?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
