    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Terminer de quitter la maison", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Cr\u00e9ez une application de contr\u00f4le en quittant la maison qui affiche les appareils laiss\u00e9s allum\u00e9s, l'\u00e9tat de verrouillage et les param\u00e8tres d'\u00e9nergie sur un seul \u00e9cran.Ajoutez des boutons d\u2019arr\u00eat rapide et d\u2019activation de s\u00e9curit\u00e9.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "V\u00e9rifiez les appareils laiss\u00e9s allum\u00e9s, les serrures et l\u2019\u00e9tat \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique en un seul flux lorsque vous quittez la maison.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Affichez les appareils laiss\u00e9s allum\u00e9s, les verrous et l'\u00e9tat \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique sur un seul \u00e9cran lorsque vous quittez la maison.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Visualisez les lumi\u00e8res, les prises, les climatiseurs et les param\u00e8tres de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 laiss\u00e9s allum\u00e9s avant de quitter la maison, sur un seul panneau.Rassemblez les \u00e9tapes d\u2019arr\u00eat rapide et d\u2019activation de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 en un seul flux.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Faisons les derni\u00e8res v\u00e9rifications avant votre d\u00e9part.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "\u00c9teignez automatiquement les lumi\u00e8res apr\u00e8s votre d\u00e9part...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
