    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "\u00c9teignez automatiquement les lumi\u00e8res apr\u00e8s votre d\u00e9part et allumez-les \u00e0 votre retour.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "\u00c9teignez automatiquement le climatiseur lorsque personne n'est \u00e0 la maison et \u00e9vitez toute consommation inutile.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Coupez automatiquement l'alimentation des appareils en veille \u00e0 l'heure que vous choisissez la nuit.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
