    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "NEXUS AI apprend vos habitudes et transforme votre maison en un espace de vie con\u00e7u sp\u00e9cialement pour vous.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
