    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Il y a un appareil \u00e0 cette adresse, mais il ne parle pas de protocole NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Cet appareil est d\u00e9j\u00e0 ajout\u00e9.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Associez et ajoutez", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Le code d'appairage n'est pas valide.Saisissez le code \u00e0 11 chiffres ou le contenu QR commen\u00e7ant par MT\u00a0:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Entrez ce code dans l'application de bureau NEXUS.Si l'appareil est en Wi-Fi, vous pouvez \u00e9galement l'ajouter depuis votre r\u00e9seau local par son adresse IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "L'appareil est recherch\u00e9 sur le m\u00eame r\u00e9seau et coupl\u00e9.Cela peut prendre jusqu'\u00e0 une minute\u00a0;l'appareil doit \u00eatre allum\u00e9 et en mode appairage.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "L'appareil n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9 ou n'a pas pu \u00eatre coupl\u00e9.Assurez-vous qu'il est sur le m\u00eame r\u00e9seau, allum\u00e9 et en mode appairage.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "L'appareil n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9.Assurez-vous qu'il est sur le m\u00eame r\u00e9seau, allum\u00e9 et en mode appairage.Le pare-feu de votre ordinateur bloque peut-\u00eatre les r\u00e9ponses des appareils du r\u00e9seau local.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "L'appareil n'a pas pu \u00eatre coupl\u00e9.V\u00e9rifiez le code d'appairage et que l'appareil est en mode d'appairage.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "L'appareil est coupl\u00e9 mais n'a aucune fonction que NEXUS peut contr\u00f4ler.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "L'appareil n'a pas r\u00e9pondu.Assurez-vous qu'il est sur et sur le m\u00eame r\u00e9seau.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
