    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131 i\u00e7in e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f bir klima bulunamad\u0131. \u00d6nce Cihazlar b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnden cihaz\u0131n\u0131 e\u015fle\u015ftir.": "Aucun climatiseur coupl\u00e9 n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 trouv\u00e9 pour le contr\u00f4le de la temp\u00e9rature.Associez d'abord votre appareil dans la section Appareils.", // EN: No paired AC found for temperature control. Pair your device in the Devices section first.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 dengeli profile \u00e7ek.": "D\u00e9placez les appareils de temp\u00e9rature vers un profil \u00e9quilibr\u00e9.", // EN: Move temperature devices to a balanced profile.
