    "TV Ortam I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131": "Lumi\u00e8re ambiante du t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur", // EN: TV Ambient Light
    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "Cr\u00e9ez une sc\u00e8ne de cin\u00e9ma tamis\u00e9e pour la salle de t\u00e9l\u00e9vision.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Cr\u00e9ez une application en mode cin\u00e9ma pour les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs et les appareils multim\u00e9dias.Incluez le d\u00e9marrage du film, le volume, les lumi\u00e8res ambiantes et les raccourcis de divertissement en soir\u00e9e sans distraction.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Panneau de divertissement en un seul clic pour les t\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs et les appareils multim\u00e9dias.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "T\u00e9l\u00e9viseurs, haut-parleurs et appareils de divertissement", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Combinez le t\u00e9l\u00e9viseur, le bo\u00eetier multim\u00e9dia et les lumi\u00e8res d'ambiance en une seule action.Facilitez la configuration du d\u00e9marrage du film, du mode nuit et des sc\u00e8nes de divertissement sans distraction.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Bien s\u00fbr!Je peux vous concocter un excellent sc\u00e9nario intelligent.Pourriez-vous me donner quelques d\u00e9tails ?Par exemple : \u00ab Allumer la machine \u00e0 caf\u00e9 quand je me r\u00e9veille \u00bb ou \u00ab Baisser compl\u00e8tement la lumi\u00e8re quand je regarde un film \u00bb.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
