    "Temizlik ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS AI, yerdeki engelleri alg\u0131layacak ve ses seviyesini odadaki doluluk durumuna g\u00f6re otomatik ayarlayacakt\u0131r.": "Lorsque le nettoyage commence, NEXUS AI d\u00e9tecte les obstacles au sol et ajuste automatiquement le volume en fonction de l'occupation de la pi\u00e8ce.", // EN: When cleaning starts, NEXUS AI detects obstacles on the floor and adjusts the volume automatically based on room occupancy.
