    "Mesajlar \u015fifreli olarak g\u00f6nderilir ve saklan\u0131r. Bu evin \u00fcyeleri d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda kimse okuyamaz; ev silinirse mesajlar da silinir.": "Les messages sont envoy\u00e9s et stock\u00e9s crypt\u00e9s.Personne en dehors des membres de ce foyer ne peut les lire\u00a0;si la maison est supprim\u00e9e, les messages sont \u00e9galement supprim\u00e9s.", // EN: Messages are sent and stored encrypted. Nobody outside this home's members can read them; if the home is deleted, the messages are deleted too.
    "Daveti G\u00f6nder": "Envoyer une invitation", // EN: Send Invite
    "Sahipli\u011fi Devret": "Transf\u00e9rer la propri\u00e9t\u00e9", // EN: Transfer Ownership
    "Uygulama kapal\u0131yken aile mesaj\u0131 ve ev sahibinin payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 uyar\u0131lar gelir. Ana anahtar, kategori ve sessiz saat ayarlar\u0131n sunucuya kopyalan\u0131r; uygulamay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\u00fcncellenir.": "Les messages familiaux et les alertes partag\u00e9es par le propri\u00e9taire arrivent lorsque l'application est ferm\u00e9e.Vos param\u00e8tres d'interrupteur principal, de cat\u00e9gorie et d'heures calmes sont copi\u00e9s sur le serveur\u00a0;ils se mettent \u00e0 jour lorsque vous ouvrez l'application.", // EN: Family messages and the alerts the home owner shares arrive while the app is closed. Your master switch, category and quiet-hours settings are copied to the server; they update when you open the app.
