    "Hen\u00fcz do\u011frulanmad\u0131": "Pas encore v\u00e9rifi\u00e9", // EN: Not yet verified
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz ger\u00e7ek bir cihazla denenmedi.": "Ce type de connexion n'a pas encore \u00e9t\u00e9 test\u00e9 avec un appareil r\u00e9el.", // EN: This connection type has not been tested with a real device yet.
