    "Yedekle ve Geri Y\u00fckle": "Sauvegarde et restauration", // EN: Backup & Restore
    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Votre liste d'appareils, vos automatisations, vos sc\u00e8nes et vos param\u00e8tres sont enregistr\u00e9s dans un fichier.Les mots de passe de l'appareil, les cl\u00e9s locales, le jeton Telegram et votre session ne sont pas inclus dans la sauvegarde.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Exporter la sauvegarde", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Rapport d'erreur", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Les erreurs qui se produisent dans l'application nous sont envoy\u00e9es automatiquement et de mani\u00e8re anonyme (aucune donn\u00e9e personnelle).Vous pouvez le d\u00e9sactiver ci-dessous.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Envoyer des rapports d'erreur anonymes", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Envoyer des rapports d'erreurs anonymes", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Restaurer \u00e0 partir d'une sauvegarde", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Pr\u00eat pour vos appareils coupl\u00e9s\u00a0;ajout\u00e9 d\u2019un simple clic.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Pr\u00eat pour toi", // EN: Ready for you
    "Dokununca e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131nda hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "S'ex\u00e9cute sur vos appareils coupl\u00e9s d\u00e8s que vous appuyez dessus.", // EN: Runs on your paired devices as soon as you tap it.
    "Ayarlarda ara": "Param\u00e8tres de recherche", // EN: Search settings
    "Bu aramayla e\u015fle\u015fen ayar yok.": "Aucun param\u00e8tre ne correspond \u00e0 cette recherche.", // EN: No setting matches this search.
    "Yenilemek i\u00e7in b\u0131rak\u0131n": "Rel\u00e2chez pour actualiser", // EN: Release to refresh
    "Yenileniyor\u2026": "Rafra\u00eechissant\u2026", // EN: Refreshing…
    "Yenilendi": "Actualis\u00e9", // EN: Refreshed
