    "Ana men\u00fc": "Menu principal", // EN: Main menu
    "Temay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Changer de th\u00e8me", // EN: Change theme
    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Veuillez saisir un email valide.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Un compte avec cette adresse email existe d\u00e9j\u00e0.Veuillez vous connecter.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Ce lien a expir\u00e9 ou n'est pas valide.Veuillez r\u00e9essayer.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Le compte cloud est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 dans cette version\u00a0;les mots de passe des comptes locaux ne peuvent pas \u00eatre r\u00e9initialis\u00e9s.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Si cette adresse est li\u00e9e \u00e0 un compte, un lien de r\u00e9initialisation a \u00e9t\u00e9 envoy\u00e9.V\u00e9rifiez votre bo\u00eete de r\u00e9ception (et votre dossier spam).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Trop de tentatives.Veuillez r\u00e9essayer dans une minute.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Impossible d'envoyer le lien.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "Envoyer \u00e0 nouveau", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Votre mot de passe a \u00e9t\u00e9 mis \u00e0 jour.Vous pouvez vous connecter maintenant.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Entrez votre mot de passe actuel.", // EN: Enter your current password.
    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "Le mot de passe actuel est incorrect.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "Le nouveau mot de passe doit \u00eatre diff\u00e9rent de l'ancien.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "S\u00e9ance introuvable.D\u00e9connectez-vous et reconnectez-vous.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
    "\u015eifre g\u00fcncellenemedi.": "Impossible de mettre \u00e0 jour le mot de passe.", // EN: Could not update the password.
    "Davet e-postas\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Envoi d'un e-mail d'invitation\u2026", // EN: Sending invitation email…
    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Cet e-mail poss\u00e8de d\u00e9j\u00e0 un compte\u00a0;ils peuvent se joindre au code.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
    "Ev sahibi yetkileri kapat\u0131lamaz": "Les autorisations du propri\u00e9taire ne peuvent pas \u00eatre d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9es", // EN: Owner permissions cannot be turned off
