    "\u0130ptal edildi \u2014 d\u00f6nem sonuna kadar ge\u00e7erli": "Annul\u00e9 \u2014 valable jusqu'\u00e0 la fin de la p\u00e9riode", // EN: Cancelled — valid until the end of the period
    "Aboneli\u011fin aktif": "Votre abonnement est actif", // EN: Your subscription is active
    "T\u00fcketim Ge\u00e7mi\u015fi": "Historique d'utilisation", // EN: Usage History
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazdaki ger\u00e7ek \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerden": "7 derniers jours \u00b7 \u00e0 partir de mesures r\u00e9elles sur cet appareil uniquement", // EN: Last 7 days · from real measurements on this device only
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "7 derniers jours", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Aucune mesure enregistr\u00e9e pour l'instant.Ajoutez un appareil qui mesure la puissance et ouvrez cette page\u00a0;les lectures s'accumuleront ici.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Les intervalles sans mesures ne sont pas compt\u00e9s, les valeurs peuvent donc \u00eatre inf\u00e9rieures \u00e0 la consommation r\u00e9elle.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
