    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Partager des alertes critiques", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Le titre et le texte court des \u00e9v\u00e9nements de s\u00e9curit\u00e9/d'urgence sur cet appareil apparaissent dans les applications des autres membres de cette maison.Les d\u00e9tails et les cl\u00e9s de l'appareil ne sont jamais partag\u00e9s\u00a0;chaque membre suit ses propres param\u00e8tres de notification.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Quitter la maison", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Partir", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Saisissez le code de l'e-mail d'invitation.Le code est \u00e0 usage unique et ne fonctionne qu'avec l'adresse email invit\u00e9e.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Connexion requise", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Connectez-vous d\u2019abord pour inviter des membres\u00a0;vous serez automatiquement connect\u00e9 au compte de votre maison.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "L'e-mail n'a pas pu \u00eatre envoy\u00e9 depuis le serveur", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "L'invitation a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9e mais l'e-mail automatique n'a pas pu \u00eatre envoy\u00e9.Devons-nous pr\u00e9parer le texte d'invitation avec votre propre application de messagerie\u00a0?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Ouvrir l'application de messagerie", // EN: Open Mail App
